From: mkinney <2219838+mkinney@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 20 Nov 2026 08:20:24 -0800
Subject: [PATCH 1/5] fix(multiaxis): generate rotary contour rings about X

Read horizontal contour bounds as axial ball-center stations.
Use radial clearance and retract links about the fitted axis.
Keep verification and posting checks for safe and unsafe stock.

Co-Authored-By: Codex <noreply@openai.com>

Fixes #3000
